Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, later!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad? Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was... you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll kill you... I swear, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someday, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sleeping together... It's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sleeping together... It's romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If only that slumber lasted forever,\Nit would be paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you two doing\Nso early in the morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:15.21,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Six:\N'Crossroads'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you seriously engaging\Nin lewd acts like this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,under the same roof as your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's a misunderstanding! Right, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido's such a perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how did you transform \Nto your adult form?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, I never told you.\NAbout Natsumi, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was the seal incomplete or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, the seal itself was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, is something impacting \Nher mental state?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, Natsumi's kinda mentally weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Hey, now.\N--Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you two whispering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't leave this poor girl out of the loop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:04:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen here. Do something about\Ntransforming over every little thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so jealous that Shido fell for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not my fault that your body\Nis inferior to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh--?! Who you calling a munchkin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have you know I'm in a growth spurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Munchkin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you dare laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even call you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami still hasn't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That... was one of DEM's CR-units...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, before attendance, I have\Nsome sad news to announce.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, what's wrong, Tammie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did matchmaking not work out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you catfished?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ahem! Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi will be transferring\Ndue to unexpected circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trans... fer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second! Origami?! \NWhat do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know all the details myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got a call from her out of nowhere saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"I'm transferring. I'll send\Nyou the forms later."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... What school is she going to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh! Well, about that...\NShe said some school in England...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,England? Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... My stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My stomach hurts, so...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:47.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Shi--\N--You don't have to come, I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Argh! Why do I have to be like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And here I finally woke up early enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.87,0:06:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never meant to wake him up like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the tea, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, do you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did she even come to my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't tell me she bears a grudge\Nand came to get revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, N-Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since you just moved in, you probably\Ndon't know the city that well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! I was fooling Shido by\Nimpersonating her precious friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But, it's not like I know\Nall there is to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...so I might not be all too helpful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She waited until the others\Nwere gone to get revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you're fine with it, do you want\Nme to show you around the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've always spent this\Ntime of day all by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And since you're here now,\NI was hoping we could talk a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-We're friends, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! I've gotta marry this girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You'll show me around the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! Hurry, let's \Ngo! Let's go right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The number you have dialed is out\Nof the service area, not powered--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why won't she pick up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please be here, Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good thing I made it inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:47.69,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Tobiichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Answer if you're there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.41,0:07:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where in the world did \Nyou run off to, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.13,0:08:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Your lunch looks yummy, Kotori!\N--Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My brother made it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't contact Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's in school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems he left early after\Nhearing Origami transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gone missing with timing\Nlike that? Very suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, the Yamai Sisters, and Miku\Nare having lunch at their schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi and Yoshino\Nwent out to play in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... I hate to make them worry,\Nbut we can't fool them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Find Shido before Tohka \Nand the others get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I went to Origami's and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Origami! What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Water. Aren't you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have some, so let \Nme drink it like normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice and slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,F-For the time being,\Ncould you get me out of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That I can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You... joined DEM?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And abducting me?\NWas that by Westcott's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I brought you here of my own volition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,DEM is not aware of these actions of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In order to keep you out of it,\Nthis was the surest method to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a minute. Keep me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Out of what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.13,0:10:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My fight with the Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By Spirits, you mean...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. Tohka and the others\Nare no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were after the Spirit\Nwho killed your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They have nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're Spirits all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we're to stop more humans\Nlike me from being created,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we cannot allow them to continue existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka and them aren't \Neven detected as Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said you didn't have\Nto go after them anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a Self-Defense Force decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has nothing to do with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been over half a year since\NTohka transferred to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those Spirits you guys used\Nto fight are part of society now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all living like humans now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you... After seeing them all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You saying they're not changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That once a Spirit, always a Spirit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That they're so dangerous,\Nthey have to be killed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think I get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka Yatogami and the other Spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're Spirits all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They should feed my revenge, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't forgive myself for\Nslowly losing sight of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.63,0:11:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Five years ago, I swore to get\Nrevenge on the Spirits, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got so used to how things\Nare now... and that scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The reason I joined DEM was\Nbecause I finally realized it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That a life with Tohka Yatogami...\Nwas one I came to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what's so wrong with that?!\NYou know as well as I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All they want is to live normal lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... I can't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not as long as they're Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to kill more than just Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to kill the one swayed\Nby emotions... myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By taking the life of Tohka Yatogami,\NI will regain who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're fine with this, Ike?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Allowing her to act on her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's finally showing some spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No need to hinder the enthusiasm\Nof a young Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirits are what we're after in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only by letting a falling bomb drop\Ncan one truly measure its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.42,0:13:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you curious to know how far she'll go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well. I'll work behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can tell because your brows\Nwrinkle when you lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be mad with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, I have another\Ntarget in mind for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another target?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Ratatoskr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a certain ship that\Nwill get in Origami's way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and I want you to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Goetia, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido leaving early means he's too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have to train him back into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. He's a wimpy wimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.67,0:13:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Starting tomorrow, we'll\Nmake him run all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Shido had a reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Question. I heard that Master Origami\Nhas transferred schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.72,0:13:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could Shido leaving be related to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:14:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, as soon as he heard\Nabout it, Shido left at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it! That smells fishy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Smells fishy? I can't smell any fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not what I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's an expression of love! Why run away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Everyone's doing it these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be fooled, my kinswoman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Warning. I smell a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it! For starters, what are\Nyou doing here anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes! I came to visit Darling,\Nbut no one was there and it was boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the house next door was empty, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido hasn't come home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That whole Origami thing might\Nhave something to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. I think we're on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:15:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh! Tell me what's going on!\NDid something happen to Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The spatial quake alarm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another Spirit has showed up then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Curious. Shall we see who this Spirit is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do that! If the alarm\Nis sounding, we have to evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Shido is--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi! What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There is no spatial quake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? They're evacuating!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The alarm is sounding \Nbecause I requested it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Neither a Spirit nor the AST will show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Why would you do something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:41.79,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Comparison Complete"\N"Origami Tobiichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In order to kill you all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said already. To kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To kill all Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those eyes... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why have you gone back to\Nbefore, Origami Tobiichi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good on you to notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Admiration. That's our Master Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then. How about explaining\Nwhat this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Inquiry. Please answer us, Master Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't want to fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have to answer anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gabriel, Rondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't kill her, we'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--What are you doing, Tohka?!\N--But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi?! What's she doing there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's incredible magic power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's on a whole new level than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without their full Spirit armor,\NTohka and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fraxinus. Full power ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll recover Tohka and them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it gets ugly, deploy the Yggdrafolium.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Back them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been attacked!\NTerritory reduced 30 percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enemy sighted at 3 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's an airship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is... DEM's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Transmission?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Said ship is trying to reach\NFraxinus through a transmission!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Connect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:17:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for receiving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ellen Mathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.85,0:18:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you've heard of me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm honored, Kotori Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What business does the world's\Nstrongest Wizard have with us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to drink tea, let's do\Nit later. I'm busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A vile organization's troublesome pawn\Nis picking a fight with our girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've two things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One. I'll give you up to three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone who wants to live\Nshould leave the ship at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You honestly believe you \Ncan take down Fraxinus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying I can't deny the\Npossibility it might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, "Fraxinus"? The World Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elliot must have chosen the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you underestimating\NFraxinus a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With all due respect, perhaps you're\Nthe one underestimating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.32,0:19:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Both Goetia's abilities... and my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? You have more to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, to the one who fled this conflict...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a message for Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A message?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elliot... Elliot! You damn traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You turned your back on us and\Nour promise! Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter where you hide, I will\Nfind you! I will have your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's all. Starting now,\NI'll give you three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please hurry and escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're up against humanity's best.\NIf you want to flee, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I wanted to flee now, I would never\Nhave followed you from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Leaving you behind and running?\NHow is that any different than death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed! Humanity's greatest or not,\Nlet's show her what we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your orders, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My will is written and good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the hard drive in my computer back\Nhome is set to erase if I happen to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, it's hard to pass up getting\Npunished by you for running--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.85,0:20:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so? What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,AR-008! Give three to six\Nparallel driving force!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Replenish magic power! Ready Mistilteinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Target: DEM airship Goetia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori Itsuka... I thought you were\Ncapable of rational thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though you two don't share any blood,\Nyou truly are Shido's little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Best compliment ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kannazuki! Deploy Yggdrafolium\None through twelve!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the world's strongest Wizard.\NBe prepared, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you would say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's clean up quickly here\Nand get to Tohka at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Replenishment complete!\NMistilteinn, ready to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enemy ship Goetia hasn't moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sitting pretty for three minutes?\NShe's taking us lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mistilteinn, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding! What was that speed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They must have thinned out the\NTerritory surrounding the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,to maximize their mobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.24,0:21:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that driving force... They probably\Nused Territory to flick the ship aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're saying that's possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Theoretically, it could be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As expected of the immortal Mathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is no time to be \Nimpressed! She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Protect Territory! Brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've done it now! Prepare counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yggdrafolium to mine mode!\NGet them behind her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.15,0:21:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's... another bombardment!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit! Anyone?! Is anyone there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.34,0:22:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:41.53,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Seven:\N'The Power Given'"
